  "aiContextParagraph": "Recent political developments in Indonesia have centered on a high-level private meeting between President Prabowo Subianto and Dasco at the State Palace, which lasted for approximately two hours. Public interest has focused on the content of these talks, with various reports suggesting that the selection of a future vice presidential candidate was part of the agenda. Despite these claims, Dasco has publicly maintained that he has consistently prioritized his legislative work at the House of Representatives and holds no intention to enter the vice presidential race. The meeting follows a broader sequence of political consultations, including earlier discussions between the Defense Minister and Dasco regarding potential amendments to defense legislation. These interactions remain a subject of active political analysis as stakeholders monitor potential shifts in governance and policy planning at the highest levels of the Indonesian government.",
